WEBVTT

00:08.840 --> 00:15.440
<b>Picking up the yesterday that
someone threw away</b>

00:15.440 --> 00:18.780
<b>I just reached my hand out like a daredevil</b>

00:18.780 --> 00:22.080
<b>Thrusting the answer out</b>

00:22.080 --> 00:27.550
<b>No matter what I get, I won't ever be satisfied</b>

00:28.720 --> 00:34.660
<b>Escape from the gaps in your
tangled up heart</b>

00:34.660 --> 00:36.730
<b>That's right, make a treasure</b>

00:36.730 --> 00:41.970
<b>I hear your voice in the rusted time</b>

00:41.970 --> 00:45.010
<b>I want to deliver it just as it is</b>

00:45.010 --> 00:48.280
<b>You are waiting in the light</b>

00:48.280 --> 00:51.910
<b>That's what I believe</b>

00:51.910 --> 00:55.510
<b>Right away</b>

01:06.090 --> 01:08.130
<b>So, make a treasure</b>

01:08.130 --> 01:13.370
<b>I search for myself in the rusted mirror</b>

01:13.370 --> 01:16.470
<b>I want to seize it with my own hands</b>

01:16.470 --> 01:19.710
<b>You are waiting, no matter where I am</b>

01:19.710 --> 01:23.280
<b>That's what I believe</b>

01:23.280 --> 01:25.940
<b>Right away</b>

02:09.220 --> 02:10.690
<b>This is just pitiful.</b>

02:17.270 --> 02:20.000
<b>Hey, hey, hey! It's awesome!</b>

02:20.000 --> 02:22.000
<b>Look, I got a huge catch!</b>

02:22.000 --> 02:24.710
<b>Let's roast them and eat! They look so good!</b>

02:24.710 --> 02:30.850
<b>One, two, three, four...</b>

02:30.850 --> 02:37.820
<b>Five, six, seven, eight...</b>

02:37.820 --> 02:41.410
<b>Nine, ten...</b>

02:42.360 --> 02:43.850
<b>Eleven!</b>

02:44.760 --> 02:46.530
<b>Two each, okay?</b>

02:46.530 --> 02:49.730
<b>Oh? But that leaves one extra.</b>

02:49.730 --> 02:52.700
<b>Then I'll eat the one that's left over.</b>

02:52.700 --> 02:55.640
<b>Let's see, salt... Where was it?</b>

02:55.640 --> 02:58.040
<b>Come on, Hakuryu, move, move!</b>

02:58.040 --> 02:59.040
<b>Salt, salt.</b>

02:59.040 --> 02:59.540
<b>What the heck are you saying?!
Salt, salt.</b>

02:59.540 --> 03:00.580
<b>What the heck are you saying?!
Hakuryu, you're in the way!</b>

03:00.580 --> 03:01.880
<b>You always do rock-paper-scissors
when you've got an extra one.
Hakuryu, you're in the way!</b>

03:01.880 --> 03:03.750
<b>You always do rock-paper-scissors
when you've got an extra one.
Oh, it's okay. I'll just eat it.</b>

03:03.750 --> 03:05.750
<b>Well, well, these certainly are
tasty-Iooking trout.
Oh, it's okay. I'll just eat it.</b>

03:05.750 --> 03:07.050
<b>Well, well, these certainly are
tasty-Iooking trout.
Hakuryu, move it! Hey, that's
the biggest one!</b>

03:07.050 --> 03:09.920
<b>Hakuryu, move it! Hey, that's
the biggest one!</b>

03:09.920 --> 03:12.020
<b>Hakkai, are you sneaking ahead of us?!</b>

03:12.020 --> 03:14.190
<b>I'm the one who caught them!</b>

03:14.190 --> 03:17.460
<b>Moron, say you were ALLOWED
to go catch them!</b>

03:17.460 --> 03:18.950
<b>Like hell!</b>

03:42.350 --> 03:43.820
<b>Can't you sleep?</b>

03:49.760 --> 03:52.860
<b>Sanzo'll be okay, right?</b>

03:52.860 --> 03:54.330
<b>He'll be fine.</b>

04:09.310 --> 04:13.950
<b>Konzen! Hey, Konzen!</b>

04:13.950 --> 04:15.450
<b>That's not the way!</b>

04:15.450 --> 04:17.920
<b>This way's shorter to get to Tenchan's place!</b>

04:20.290 --> 04:21.790
<b>Ten... Hey!</b>

04:21.790 --> 04:23.220
<b>Hurry!</b>

04:28.100 --> 04:30.270
<b>Come on, come on, this way!</b>

04:30.270 --> 04:31.000
<b>This way, Konzen!</b>

04:31.000 --> 04:32.130
<b>Take a look, Jiroushin.
This way, Konzen!</b>

04:32.130 --> 04:32.800
<b>Take a look, Jiroushin.
Hurry!</b>

04:32.800 --> 04:34.040
<b>There's a sight you don't
get to see everyday.
Hurry!</b>

04:34.040 --> 04:34.970
<b>There's a sight you don't
get to see everyday.
See? See? It's faster if you go this way.</b>

04:34.970 --> 04:35.940
<b>See? See? It's faster if you go this way.</b>

04:35.940 --> 04:37.510
<b>What is?
See? See? It's faster if you go this way.</b>

04:37.510 --> 04:38.310
<b>Konzen. Whoever thought he'd allow
himself to be led by someone else?</b>

04:38.310 --> 04:40.580
<b>Come on, hurry! Hurry!
Konzen. Whoever thought he'd allow
himself to be led by someone else?</b>

04:40.580 --> 04:42.910
<b>Konzen. Whoever thought he'd allow
himself to be led by someone else?</b>

04:42.910 --> 04:45.250
<b>Well, well...</b>

04:45.250 --> 04:48.450
<b>That pipsqueak's something else.</b>

04:48.450 --> 04:51.750
<b>Tenchan, where should I put these?</b>

04:51.750 --> 04:55.660
<b>Oh, please line those up on the back shelf.</b>

04:55.660 --> 04:58.350
<b>Your strength is such a great help, Goku.</b>

04:59.760 --> 05:04.360
<b>I only came here because Goku
badgered me into it!</b>

05:04.900 --> 05:08.730
<b>So, why do I have to help you
clean up your room too?!</b>

05:10.240 --> 05:12.260
<b>It suits you better than expected.</b>

05:14.640 --> 05:18.050
<b>Hey, isn't Ken here today?</b>

05:18.050 --> 05:22.310
<b>There was an army roll call,
so he went to the main palace.</b>

05:22.820 --> 05:24.020
<b>What about you?</b>

05:24.020 --> 05:27.380
<b>The order to sortie was issued to
Prince Nataku's army, so...</b>

05:27.990 --> 05:31.620
<b>I've heard Nataku's still recovering.</b>

05:32.260 --> 05:36.490
<b>Yes, but I'm sure the higher-ups
care nothing about that.</b>

05:37.670 --> 05:40.540
<b>After all, he's their puppet assassin.</b>

05:40.540 --> 05:42.800
<b>Hey, can I borrow this book?</b>

05:43.510 --> 05:45.440
<b>Let me borrow it, okay, Tenchan?</b>

05:45.440 --> 05:46.910
<b>Go right ahead.</b>

05:48.240 --> 05:51.780
<b>You're interested in books?</b>

05:51.780 --> 05:57.120
<b>It's awesome! This meat bun rides a
steel box and fights evil!</b>

05:57.120 --> 06:00.280
<b>A pizza bun, curry bun, and sweet
bean-jam bun show up too!</b>

06:00.860 --> 06:02.760
<b>It all just looks so yummy!</b>

06:03.560 --> 06:05.030
<b>I've heard enough.</b>

06:06.330 --> 06:10.900
<b>Goku's mastered a general knowledge
of reading and writing.</b>

06:10.900 --> 06:14.700
<b>It seems he has a high absorption rate
of things he's interested in.</b>

06:19.940 --> 06:23.340
<b>Hey, does this library have everything?</b>

06:23.340 --> 06:26.750
<b>What? Yes, though it's
according to my tastes.</b>

06:27.780 --> 06:29.280
<b>I don't care what it is.</b>

06:29.280 --> 06:32.250
<b>Lend me something you found
interesting next time.</b>

06:34.760 --> 06:36.310
<b>Certainly, with pleasure.</b>

06:49.200 --> 06:51.670
<b>Hiding places no one else knows about</b>

06:51.670 --> 06:53.870
<b>and places where there's lots of raspberries.</b>

06:55.180 --> 06:56.800
<b>Let's go together, okay?</b>

06:59.710 --> 07:01.350
<b>Lord Nataku...</b>

07:01.350 --> 07:04.250
<b>Your father's waiting for you.
Please rise from your bed.</b>

07:14.800 --> 07:18.630
<b>Another campaign? They're
such slave drivers.</b>

07:18.630 --> 07:21.270
<b>Well, we've got the puppet assassin,</b>

07:21.270 --> 07:22.960
<b>so we can sit back and relax.</b>

07:27.540 --> 07:29.010
<b>Silence!</b>

07:33.520 --> 07:35.110
<b>Prince Nataku, approach.</b>

07:38.890 --> 07:43.090
<b>I order Prince Nataku and
his army to take the field!</b>

07:44.960 --> 07:45.960
<b>Yes, Sire.</b>

07:45.960 --> 07:47.430
<b>Please wait a moment.</b>

07:49.660 --> 07:50.770
<b>Who are you?!</b>

07:50.770 --> 07:53.370
<b>Subordinate of the Dragon King
of the Western Seas,</b>

07:53.370 --> 07:56.240
<b>Army General Kenren of the Western Army.</b>

07:57.010 --> 08:00.480
<b>What does this Army General want?</b>

08:00.480 --> 08:04.150
<b>I beg your pardon, Sire,
but from the looks of it,</b>

08:04.150 --> 08:08.320
<b>Prince Nataku has yet to fully heal from
the wounds he received</b>

08:08.320 --> 08:10.590
<b>during his subjugation of Gyumaoh.</b>

08:10.590 --> 08:16.120
<b>I ask that this order to take the field
be given to my army instead.</b>

08:16.120 --> 08:18.490
<b>What's he saying?!</b>

08:19.490 --> 08:24.560
<b>Stand back! You actually think you can
fill Prince Nataku's post?!</b>

08:25.730 --> 08:27.340
<b>I pride myself in thinking I'd do better</b>

08:27.340 --> 08:29.570
<b>than those who stay sheltered
under another's influence</b>

08:29.570 --> 08:32.040
<b>and are not even prepared
to soil their own hands.</b>

08:32.040 --> 08:34.840
<b>What're you implying, General Kenren?!</b>

08:34.840 --> 08:36.280
<b>That's enough impertinence!</b>

08:36.950 --> 08:40.540
<b>Kenren, I can't have you be so disparaging.</b>

08:41.850 --> 08:45.520
<b>My son, Nataku, is the best warrior in
the Heavens, bar none.</b>

08:45.520 --> 08:49.190
<b>If it's for the Heavens, he's sure to
take the field himself,</b>

08:49.190 --> 08:50.990
<b>ready to risk his own life.</b>

08:53.830 --> 08:55.320
<b>Is that not right, Nataku?</b>

08:56.260 --> 08:57.730
<b>As you say.</b>

09:01.200 --> 09:03.300
<b>You may step back, Nataku.</b>

09:16.990 --> 09:18.450
<b>Thank you.</b>

09:29.400 --> 09:31.400
<b>Now, General Kenren,</b>

09:31.400 --> 09:34.400
<b>opposing the orders of the
Jade Emperor is blasphemous!</b>

09:34.400 --> 09:36.270
<b>Therefore, you'll be confined
to your residence!</b>

09:42.380 --> 09:46.180
<b>What?! I still can't see Nataku?!</b>

09:46.180 --> 09:48.220
<b>I haven't been able to see him at all!</b>

09:48.220 --> 09:51.720
<b>Is he really doing that badly?</b>

09:51.720 --> 09:55.160
<b>Yes, I feel bad when you're coming
to see him everyday, but...</b>

09:56.260 --> 09:59.350
<b>Okay, if he's not doing well,
I guess it can't be helped.</b>

10:00.190 --> 10:02.820
<b>Would you give this to Nataku for me?</b>

10:03.830 --> 10:05.360
<b>Yes, I can do that.</b>

10:10.910 --> 10:13.340
<b>Confined to my residence, my ass!</b>

10:13.340 --> 10:16.810
<b>This is called torturing and then imprisoning.</b>

10:16.810 --> 10:19.210
<b>Why did you not consult me?</b>

10:19.210 --> 10:22.820
<b>If I had brought up the matter,
the Jade Emperor may have...</b>

10:22.820 --> 10:26.420
<b>I wanted to say it then and there.
Just felt like it.</b>

10:26.420 --> 10:28.420
<b>Even after what you've been through?</b>

10:28.420 --> 10:30.480
<b>Not like it's a big deal anyway.</b>

10:35.030 --> 10:38.260
<b>Nataku's little punch hurt a hell of a lot more.</b>

10:39.130 --> 10:41.470
<b>Acting like a full-fledged
adult when he's only a kid.</b>

10:42.540 --> 10:45.170
<b>It hurts a lot more to have to watch that.</b>

10:46.410 --> 10:52.370
<b>But maybe what hurts most is
that he can't even say it hurts.</b>

10:53.380 --> 10:54.850
<b>Merciful Goddess...</b>

10:56.050 --> 10:57.540
<b>About this document...</b>

10:59.050 --> 11:01.020
<b>What is that?</b>

11:01.020 --> 11:02.890
<b>Doesn't it look good on me?</b>

11:02.890 --> 11:05.790
<b>I wouldn't think so, but did you...</b>

11:05.790 --> 11:08.900
<b>Make it? No way. I picked it up.</b>

11:08.900 --> 11:10.490
<b>Picked it up?</b>

11:11.570 --> 11:14.800
<b>What?! Nataku still isn't doing well?!</b>

11:14.800 --> 11:15.170
<b>Yes, so you won't be able to see him today.</b>

11:15.170 --> 11:19.060
<b>Flowers that left the hands of their
master and were abandoned.</b>

11:25.850 --> 11:28.420
<b>Idiot! That hurts, you little runt!</b>

11:28.420 --> 11:30.420
<b>Don't mind him, Goku.</b>

11:30.420 --> 11:34.160
<b>Do it as tight as you can,
so it won't come loose.</b>

11:34.160 --> 11:37.490
<b>Bastard, you got something against me?</b>

11:37.490 --> 11:42.230
<b>Against you? Goodness, no. In fact,
I can't help but feel sympathetic.</b>

11:43.360 --> 11:45.170
<b>Due to your concern for another,</b>

11:45.170 --> 11:47.570
<b>you recklessly advised the Jade Emperor,</b>

11:47.570 --> 11:50.340
<b>received physical punishment harsh
enough to break ribs,</b>

11:50.340 --> 11:52.400
<b>and yet you're still laughing like a fool.</b>

11:53.010 --> 11:57.210
<b>I feel for the subordinates who
serve such a dumb general.</b>

11:57.210 --> 12:01.550
<b>Yeah, yeah, I can't help it.
It's just the way I am.</b>

12:01.550 --> 12:03.350
<b>I know.</b>

12:03.350 --> 12:07.120
<b>But it was a mistake to make
Li Touten your enemy.</b>

12:07.120 --> 12:09.920
<b>You were dismissed just earlier.</b>

12:11.390 --> 12:12.730
<b>Really?</b>

12:12.730 --> 12:14.620
<b>Don't you "really" me. Honestly!</b>

12:15.530 --> 12:18.870
<b>I just can't be as good-natured as you.</b>

12:18.870 --> 12:20.870
<b>If you'll allow my ego to speak,</b>

12:20.870 --> 12:24.670
<b>I'm not so adroit that I can
work under just anyone.</b>

12:27.340 --> 12:28.240
<b>Hey!</b>

12:28.240 --> 12:30.140
<b>I'll be going out for a bit.</b>

12:30.140 --> 12:32.640
<b>The injured should wait here quietly.</b>

12:33.350 --> 12:36.080
<b>Goku, please watch him.</b>

12:36.080 --> 12:37.720
<b>See you later!</b>

12:37.720 --> 12:40.650
<b>Wai... Hey! What about going to the john?!</b>

12:41.960 --> 12:44.320
<b>If you get cystitis, I'll treat you.</b>

12:51.200 --> 12:54.500
<b>Hey, Goku, would you go
after Tenpou for me?</b>

12:55.400 --> 12:56.570
<b>I'm on watch duty.</b>

12:56.570 --> 12:58.030
<b>Forget about that!</b>

13:00.010 --> 13:03.500
<b>He might not look it, but he's
more impulsive than I am.</b>

13:05.480 --> 13:07.050
<b>What's impulsive?</b>

13:07.050 --> 13:08.520
<b>Well, basically...</b>

13:10.380 --> 13:12.950
<b>...he flies off the handle more easily.</b>

13:12.950 --> 13:17.390
<b>To what do I owe a visit from Field
Marshal Tenpou himself?</b>

13:17.390 --> 13:19.990
<b>Guessing at each other's hidden
intentions is a waste of time,</b>

13:19.990 --> 13:21.550
<b>so I'll get right to the point.</b>

13:22.360 --> 13:25.200
<b>I'd like you to drop the dismissal
of General Kenren.</b>

13:26.770 --> 13:30.360
<b>I thought you'd come. Well, take a seat.</b>

13:31.070 --> 13:34.010
<b>I don't like saying such things,</b>

13:34.010 --> 13:37.580
<b>but since when have you been in a
position to offer me a seat,</b>

13:37.580 --> 13:39.080
<b>Li Touten?</b>

13:39.080 --> 13:42.980
<b>To begin, you're utterly unrelated to
the Heavenly Army, correct?</b>

13:43.680 --> 13:47.280
<b>I can't think you have the authority to
meddle with the army.</b>

13:49.390 --> 13:53.880
<b>The Jade Emperor has entrusted all
matters of the army to me already.</b>

13:56.230 --> 13:59.130
<b>My will is the will of the Jade Emperor!</b>

13:59.700 --> 14:01.770
<b>Are you not ashamed?</b>

14:01.770 --> 14:03.570
<b>You gained your current status</b>

14:03.570 --> 14:07.410
<b>only by using your own son, Prince Nataku.</b>

14:09.980 --> 14:11.950
<b>You've got a pretty face.</b>

14:11.950 --> 14:15.320
<b>Are you so particular about General Kenren</b>

14:15.320 --> 14:18.110
<b>because he's your husband?</b>

14:19.250 --> 14:20.690
<b>How rude.</b>

14:22.760 --> 14:23.930
<b>Lord Li Touten!</b>

14:23.930 --> 14:25.380
<b>Insolent bastard! Seize him!</b>

14:30.730 --> 14:34.430
<b>What a wonderful sight,
Field Marshal Tenpou.</b>

14:34.970 --> 14:40.970
<b>Do you see? You no longer have the right
to look at me in that way.</b>

14:41.580 --> 14:43.040
<b>And you never will again!</b>

14:46.880 --> 14:51.590
<b>I bet men like you are
challenging torture subjects.</b>

14:51.590 --> 14:55.290
<b>Don't pick on Tenchan!</b>

14:55.290 --> 14:56.590
<b>Who the hell is this brat?!</b>

14:56.590 --> 14:56.790
<b>Goku?! Why are you...
Who the hell is this brat?!</b>

14:56.790 --> 14:58.550
<b>Goku?! Why are you...</b>

14:59.690 --> 15:01.160
<b>Ken asked me to.</b>

15:01.900 --> 15:03.890
<b>He said to bring you back.</b>

15:05.100 --> 15:06.570
<b>Is that so?</b>

15:08.470 --> 15:09.940
<b>What in the world...</b>

15:10.670 --> 15:13.110
<b>I won't let you get away with
picking on Tenchan!</b>

15:13.110 --> 15:14.570
<b>You eel-head!</b>

15:16.410 --> 15:17.880
<b>Let's go, Tenchan.</b>

15:19.050 --> 15:20.510
<b>Yes, yes.</b>

15:24.420 --> 15:26.990
<b>Is it all right to just let them go?</b>

15:26.990 --> 15:29.790
<b>It doesn't matter, for now at least.</b>

15:33.130 --> 15:37.230
<b>What's with the matching looks?</b>

15:37.230 --> 15:40.230
<b>Well, we indulged in a little
pro-wrestling game,</b>

15:40.230 --> 15:41.870
<b>in spite of our age.</b>

15:41.870 --> 15:43.640
<b>Don't I look more handsome now?</b>

15:43.640 --> 15:48.280
<b>Liars. You better not have gotten into
trouble again, Goku.</b>

15:48.280 --> 15:52.770
<b>What? Let me see... It's a secret,
so I don't know.</b>

15:57.120 --> 16:01.360
<b>Whatever. Don't drag Goku into
anything too weird.</b>

16:01.360 --> 16:03.920
<b>He's unwelcome enough as it is.</b>

16:03.920 --> 16:07.900
<b>So, I'm sure you didn't come here to
show me your dirty little faces.</b>

16:07.900 --> 16:09.760
<b>What do you want today?</b>

16:09.760 --> 16:12.500
<b>The army issued a summons just now.</b>

16:12.500 --> 16:15.060
<b>Seems Prince Nataku is returning
from the Lower World.</b>

16:16.200 --> 16:17.760
<b>Wanna go together to welcome him back?</b>

16:18.840 --> 16:20.310
<b>I'll go!</b>

16:22.080 --> 16:22.940
<b>What about you?</b>

16:22.940 --> 16:26.410
<b>No, I have to deliver this to the old hag.</b>

16:26.410 --> 16:27.880
<b>Let's go, let's go! Hurry!</b>

16:28.620 --> 16:29.320
<b>Sure thing.</b>

16:29.320 --> 16:31.350
<b>I'll finally get to see Nataku!
Tenpou...</b>

16:31.350 --> 16:34.360
<b>I know. You're saying it's dangerous</b>

16:34.360 --> 16:37.650
<b>for Goku and Prince Nataku to
become too close, right?</b>

16:39.360 --> 16:42.060
<b>It's true, Li Touten is a shrewd man.</b>

16:42.060 --> 16:45.270
<b>He has only ambition, with no
redeeming traits at all,</b>

16:45.270 --> 16:50.810
<b>but even so, I guess we end up
wanting to see it anyway.</b>

16:50.810 --> 16:51.240
<b>That child's smile...</b>

16:51.240 --> 16:54.340
<b>What the heck? Quit it.</b>

16:58.210 --> 17:02.350
<b>Dismissed?! Kenren? From his
post as Army General?</b>

17:02.350 --> 17:04.050
<b>It was an unsuccessful attempt.</b>

17:04.050 --> 17:07.250
<b>It seems Tenpou went himself to
negotiate and got them to drop it.</b>

17:09.060 --> 17:13.960
<b>But knowing Li Touten,
it'll come with a price.</b>

17:13.960 --> 17:17.570
<b>Then their injuries...</b>

17:17.570 --> 17:18.830
<b>Injuries?</b>

17:18.830 --> 17:21.230
<b>They didn't tell me any of this.</b>

17:22.440 --> 17:25.030
<b>They probably didn't think
it was worth telling.</b>

17:25.840 --> 17:28.840
<b>Am I the only one who knows nothing about</b>

17:28.840 --> 17:31.610
<b>the movements in the upper ranks and
what's going on in the army?</b>

17:31.610 --> 17:33.080
<b>It makes me sick!</b>

17:34.180 --> 17:35.650
<b>Brat.</b>

17:36.620 --> 17:39.520
<b>There are some things you won't know
unless you try to find out.</b>

17:39.520 --> 17:43.720
<b>Just how many years have
you been living for?</b>

17:56.900 --> 17:58.390
<b>Nataku! Nataku!</b>

18:00.140 --> 18:02.380
<b>Welcome back!</b>

18:02.380 --> 18:03.840
<b>Nataku!</b>

18:04.710 --> 18:06.300
<b>You!</b>

18:11.350 --> 18:14.290
<b>Nataku?! Nataku!</b>

18:14.290 --> 18:16.960
<b>It's me! Have you forgotten about me?!</b>

18:16.960 --> 18:20.230
<b>Nataku, come on! Nataku!</b>

18:20.230 --> 18:21.690
<b>Nataku!</b>

18:23.500 --> 18:27.590
<b>Will you be able to continue
to be that little runt's sun?</b>

19:17.950 --> 19:19.420
<b>Sanzo?</b>

19:29.360 --> 19:32.390
<b>What's the matter? Have a bad
dream or something?</b>

19:40.710 --> 19:42.240
<b>What?</b>

19:42.240 --> 19:45.040
<b>What's with me? It's so weird.</b>

19:46.410 --> 19:48.650
<b>What are you crying for?</b>

19:48.650 --> 19:50.140
<b>Because... Because, you know...</b>

19:52.490 --> 19:57.080
<b>I caught some fish yesterday, real tasty ones.</b>

19:57.830 --> 20:02.000
<b>So, I wanted to eat them
with everyone together,</b>

20:02.000 --> 20:04.630
<b>but you wouldn't wake up at all.</b>

20:04.630 --> 20:07.190
<b>I... just sort of...</b>

20:08.400 --> 20:11.270
<b>It's just dinner. What are you, an idiot?</b>

20:14.280 --> 20:15.740
<b>Let's go!</b>

20:16.510 --> 20:17.980
<b>Yeah!</b>

20:46.710 --> 20:55.510
<b>All people coming and going
carry heavy burdens</b>

20:56.880 --> 21:07.320
<b>Find tomorrow within the mirage
wavering in the distance</b>

21:08.660 --> 21:18.770
<b>Emotions like the sand spilling
out of my hands</b>

21:20.110 --> 21:33.090
<b>The words that pierced my heart back
then suddenly ache</b>

21:33.090 --> 21:44.530
<b>Counting the endless nights,
I search for pieces of me</b>

21:44.530 --> 21:55.810
<b>The more I lose, the more certain
this feeling becomes</b>

21:55.810 --> 22:07.980
<b>Now, I can surely walk on and on forever</b>
